<title>TUNISIA: PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Jan 6.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Jan 6.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Tunisian press on Monday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>LA PRESSE</p>
<p>- President Ben Ali sends condolences to the family of soccer player Hedi Ben Rekhissa who died on Saturday after a heart attack.</p>
<p>LE TEMPS</p>
<p>- Arab interior ministers adopt an anti-terrorism strategy at the end of their annual session held in Tunis over the weekend.</p>
</text>
